    "answer": "all-America/pan-American/all-of-America",
    "mnemonic": "Do you remember how <ja>米国</ja> can mean \"America?\" That <ja>米</ja> means America sometimes. So, when you see <kanji>all</kanji> <kanji>rice</kanji> (I mean, <kanji>America</kanji>), you can think of this word as meaning <vocabulary>All America</vocabulary> (sort of like how <ja>全日本</ja> means \"All Japan.\").",
